==================================================

Use PostgreSQL as the authoritative data store.

Create migrations, foreign keys, indexes, constraints,
and parameterized database queries.

Minimum tables:
- users
- urban_areas
- datasets
- energy_records
- validation_results
- import_history
- planning_actions
- planning_milestones
